# The TI-58C: filled, then started again the way 2.3.0 starts it (first step 11).
model TI-58C
boot
keys 4 2 STO 0 5
keys Fix 2
keys 3 Op 1 7
keys LRN 1 + 2 = R/S LRN
keys CLR
save-ram
app-poweron
boot
keys RCL 0 5
keys Op 1 6
keys RST R/S
idle
app-reset
boot
keys RCL 0 5
app-coldboot
boot
keys RCL 0 5
